<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},
<p>Thank you for getting in touch with the Qantas Customer Care team regarding your flight to {{{Case.Arrival_Aiport__c}}}.<br />
<br />
<strong>Our commitment to high standards</strong><br />
<br />
We want all our customers to have an enjoyable journey when they travel with us, so I'm sorry to hear that there were <strong><em>&lt;insufficient/no&gt; </em></strong>meals loaded on this flight.<br />
<br />
I looked into this as soon as I received your report, and I’ve followed it up with our catering management. They advised me that <strong><em>&lt;outcome of investigation&gt;</em></strong>.<br />
&nbsp;&nbsp;<br />
<strong><em>If vouchers provided by airport:-</em></strong><br />
<br />
I hope that you were able to make use of the vouchers offered by our staff&nbsp; on your <strong><em>arrival into</em></strong> {{{Case.Arrival_City__c}}}<strong><em>/prior to departure from</em></strong> {{{Case.Arrival_City__c}}}.<br />
<br />
<em><strong>-If no food provided</strong></em>:-<br />
<br />
<strong><em>If a Frequent Flyer:-</em></strong><br />
<br />
<strong>A little something from us</strong><br />
&nbsp;<br />
As a gesture of goodwill, I’ve credited {{{Case.Recovery_Quantity__c}}} Qantas Points to your Frequent Flyer account.&nbsp;<br />
<br />
<strong><em>If not a Frequent Flyer:-</em></strong><br />
<br />
As a gesture of goodwill, I’d like to arrange a credit of {{{Case.Recovery_Quantity__c}}} Qantas Points to you..<br />
<br />
Please can you let me know your Frequent Flyer number by replying to this email so I can credit points to your account. If you’re not already a member you can use this <a href="https://www.qantas.com/en-au/frequent-flyer/join/code/familyfree">link</a>&nbsp;to join free of charge.<br />
<br />
<br />
<strong>We value your opinion</strong><br />
<br />
Customer feedback is extremely important to us so that we can provide you with exceptional service each time you fly with Qantas.<br />
<br />
I want to assure you your comments have been passed on to the relevant team.<br />
&nbsp;<br />
Thank you for letting us know about your experience&nbsp;— I hope that we can make you more comfortable next time you travel with us.</p>
</body>
